  "wgServerConfig": {
    "$comment": "The phone-side WireGuard configuration, in the flat IPC dialect wireguard-go's Device.IpcSet consumes: lowercase names, hex keys, and a peer section opened by public_key. Android asserts WgConfig.serverConfig produces exactly this; Go asserts a real device accepts it. Either check alone is worth little — one is agreement without validity, the other validity without agreement.",
